@startuml
' 전동기 Use Case Diagram — 요구사항 명세서 v0.2 5.1절 기준
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "세입자" as Tenant
actor "공동 계약자" as CoTenant
actor "관리자" as Admin
actor "스케줄러" as Scheduler
actor "LLM API" as LLM <<system>>
actor "이메일 발송 서버" as Mail <<system>>

rectangle "전동기" {
  usecase "UC-001 계약 전 위험 확인" as UC1
  usecase "UC-002 등기부 점검·판정" as UC2
  usecase "UC-003 패키지 시작·계약 당일 체크" as UC3
  usecase "UC-004 할 일 관리·증빙 기록" as UC4
  usecase "UC-005 날짜 변경 재계산" as UC5
  usecase "UC-006 등기부 재비교\n(계약 당일·잔금일)" as UC6
  usecase "UC-007 역전세 경보 재계산" as UC7
  usecase "UC-008 갈아타기" as UC8
  usecase "UC-009 반환 대응" as UC9
  usecase "UC-010 규칙·공공데이터 관리" as UC10
  usecase "UC-011 기한 알림 수신" as UC11
}

Tenant --> UC1
Tenant --> UC2
Tenant --> UC3
Tenant --> UC4
Tenant --> UC5
Tenant --> UC6
Tenant --> UC8
Tenant --> UC9
Tenant --> UC11
CoTenant --> UC11
Scheduler --> UC7
Scheduler --> UC11
Admin --> UC7
Admin --> UC10

UC2 .> UC1 : <<extend>>\n등기부를 올릴 때
UC6 .> UC3 : <<extend>>\n점검일 ≠ 계약일
UC8 .> UC4 : <<extend>>
UC9 .> UC4 : <<extend>>

UC2 --> LLM
UC11 --> Mail

note right of UC3
  전제: UC-002 판정이
  "문제 항목"이 아닐 때만 시작
end note
@enduml
